Hi,

I'm looking for a way to prepare a presentation out of my R Markdown file.

According to this  this  post <http://rprogramming.net/create-a-slideshow-powerpoint-with-r-knitr-pandoc-and-slidy/> it is possible to create such a slideshow, however their link to Pandoc is broken.

Is there any way to create such slideshow? Preferably a PowerPoint one?

Thanks,

Ofrit

