Here is the link to Pandoc:
https://github.com/jgm/pandoc

I suspect however, that as of RStudio 0.98 you won't be needing it. Try this guide:
https://support.rstudio.com/hc/en-us/articles/200486468-Authoring-R-Presentations

Also-
I would not have my hopes too high on ppt.Then again, there are several pdf readers that are aimed at presentations and not documents. Here is a nice list:
http://superuser.com/questions/339404/solutions-for-presenting-pdf-slides-with-presenter-notes-on-second-display
I can give recommendations for linux. I have no idea which is a good alternative for Windows.

